OL,3,GNEWSASign 'monstrosities' refused      
OL,4,Aplanning permission                    
OL,6,FThree giant digital advertising screens
OL,7,Fbranded "monstrosities" have been      
OL,8,Frefused permission after planners ruled
OL,9,Fthey harm the town centre.             
OL,11,FThe advertising boards appeared at     
OL,12,FBorough Parade in Chippenham,          
OL,13,FWiltshire, at the end of August without
OL,14,Fconsent.                               
OL,16,FA retrospective application was        
OL,17,Fsubmitted in an attempt to keep them in
OL,18,Fplace which the council has now        
OL,19,Frefused, saying the screens are        
OL,20,F"inappropriate, intrusive and overly   
OL,21,Flarge" and create problematic pinch    
OL,22,Fpoints for pedestrians.                
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
