OL,3,GNEWSASign 'monstrosities' refused      
OL,4,Aplanning permission                    
OL,6,FThe applicant, which has been contacted
OL,7,Fby BBC Wiltshire, still has the right  
OL,8,Fto appeal ` and has now eight weeks    
OL,9,Ffrom the decision to do so.            
